[{"id":"baatha-7-14-4","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju oživljeni","en":"they are resurrected"},{"bs":"biva oživljen","en":"he/it is resurrected"},{"bs":"pošalji!","en":"send!"},{"bs":"budi vas","en":"he/it awakens you (all)"}],"ref":"7:14","answerWord":"يُبْعَثُونَ","answerSound":"audio/444b650aeba14023bb7d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Reprieve me till the day when they are raised (from the dead).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَنظِرْنِىٓ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","يُبْعَثُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-7-103-1","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"poslali smo","en":"we sent"},{"bs":"oživio ga je","en":"he/it resurrected him"},{"bs":"pa pošaljite!","en":"so (you all) send!"},{"bs":"bivaju oživljeni","en":"they are resurrected"}],"ref":"7:103","answerWord":"بَعَثْنَا","answerSound":"audio/db9aba729251d4269863.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, after them, We sent Moses with our tokens unto Pharaoh and his chiefs, but they repelled them. Now, see the nature of the consequence for the corrupters!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِم","مُّوسَىٰ","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","إِلَىٰ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦ","فَظَلَمُوا۟","بِهَا","فَٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-25-41-8","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"poslao je","en":"he/it sent"},{"bs":"(Allah neće) proživjeti","en":"(God will never) raise"},{"bs":"budi vas","en":"he/it awakens you (all)"},{"bs":"poslali smo","en":"we sent"}],"ref":"25:41","answerWord":"بَعَثَ","answerSound":"audio/918e0ad9b60bf9b275d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they see thee (O Muhammad) they treat thee only as a jest (saying): Is this he whom Allah sendeth as a messenger?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","رَأَوْكَ","إِن","يَتَّخِذُونَكَ","إِلَّا","هُزُوًا","أَهَٰذَا","ٱلَّذِى","بَعَثَ","ٱللَّهُ","رَسُولًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-72-7-6","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"(Allah neće) proživjeti","en":"(God will never) raise"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti oživljeni","en":"surely you (all) will be resurrected"},{"bs":"zar je poslao?","en":"did he/it send?"},{"bs":"pa pošaljite!","en":"so (you all) send!"}],"ref":"72:7","answerWord":"يَبْعَثَ","answerSound":"audio/5a95230be93f12a622f9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And indeed they supposed, even as ye suppose, that Allah would not raise anyone (from the dead) -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَأَنَّهُمْ","ظَنُّوا۟","كَمَا","ظَنَنتُمْ","أَن","لَّن","يَبْعَثَ","ٱللَّهُ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-6-36-5","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava ih","en":"he/it resurrects them"},{"bs":"poslali smo","en":"we sent"},{"bs":"i pošalji!","en":"and send!"},{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we resurrect"}],"ref":"6:36","answerWord":"يَبْعَثُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/b3f3a71ce75103aa1b62.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Only those can accept who hear. As for the dead, Allah will raise them up; then unto Him they will be returned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","يَسْتَجِيبُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَسْمَعُونَ","وَٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","يَبْعَثُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","يُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-26-36-3","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"i pošalji!","en":"and send!"},{"bs":"pa je poslao","en":"so he/it sent"},{"bs":"oživljava te","en":"he/it resurrects you"},{"bs":"poslali smo","en":"we sent"}],"ref":"26:36","answerWord":"وَٱبْعَثْ","answerSound":"audio/bc45cc9c381fc3b120b2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Put him off, (him) and his brother, and send into the cities summoners","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","أَرْجِهْ","وَأَخَاهُ","وَٱبْعَثْ","فِى","ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ","حَٰشِرِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-16-38-5","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it resurrects"},{"bs":"poslali smo","en":"we sent"},{"bs":"pošalji!","en":"send!"},{"bs":"pa je poslao","en":"so he/it sent"}],"ref":"16:38","answerWord":"يَبْعَثُ","answerSound":"audio/ce8158814e01ded1d1b8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they swear by Allah their most binding oaths (that) Allah will not raise up him who dieth. Nay, but it is a promise (binding) upon Him in truth, but most of mankind know not,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَٰنِهِمْ","لَا","يَبْعَثُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَن","يَمُوتُ","بَلَىٰ","وَعْدًا","عَلَيْهِ","حَقًّا","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-16-84-1","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we resurrect"},{"bs":"biva oživljen","en":"he/it is resurrected"},{"bs":"budi vas","en":"he/it awakens you (all)"},{"bs":"zaista će poslati","en":"surely he/it will send"}],"ref":"16:84","answerWord":"نَبْعَثُ","answerSound":"audio/4f147ce6f2c31efb3018.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (bethink you of) the day when we raise up of every nation a witness, then there is no leave for disbelievers, nor are they allowed to make amends.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَيَوْمَ","نَبْعَثُ","مِن","كُلِّ","أُمَّةٍ","شَهِيدًا","ثُمَّ","لَا","يُؤْذَنُ","لِلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَلَا","هُمْ","يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-18-12-1","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"probudili smo ih","en":"we awakened them"},{"bs":"i poslali smo","en":"and we sent"},{"bs":"oživljava ih","en":"he/it resurrects them"},{"bs":"oživljava te","en":"he/it resurrects you"}],"ref":"18:12","answerWord":"بَعَثْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ee5271180965d3317cec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And afterward We raised them up that We might know which of the two parties would best calculate the time that they had tarried.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَٰهُمْ","لِنَعْلَمَ","أَىُّ","ٱلْحِزْبَيْنِ","أَحْصَىٰ","لِمَا","لَبِثُوٓا۟","أَمَدًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-2-56-1","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"proživjeli smo vas","en":"We raised you"},{"bs":"(Allah neće) proživjeti","en":"(God will never) raise"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti oživljeni","en":"surely you (all) will be resurrected"},{"bs":"bivam oživljen","en":"I am resurrected"}],"ref":"2:56","answerWord":"بَعَثْنَٰكُم","answerSound":"audio/40ed7b77cf654dc9e8c2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We revived you after your extinction, that ye might give thanks.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَٰكُم","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَوْتِكُمْ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَشْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-4-35-4","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa pošaljite!","en":"so (you all) send!"},{"bs":"oživio nas je","en":"he/it resurrected us"},{"bs":"proživjeli smo vas","en":"We raised you"},{"bs":"šaljemo","en":"we send"}],"ref":"4:35","answerWord":"فَٱبْعَثُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9bfb3b7aa749461f7932.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if ye fear a breach between them twain (the man and wife), appoint an arbiter from his folk and an arbiter from her folk. If they desire amendment Allah will make them of one mind. Lo! Allah is ever Knower, Aware.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَإِنْ","خِفْتُمْ","شِقَاقَ","بَيْنِهِمَا","فَٱبْعَثُوا۟","حَكَمًا","مِّنْ","أَهْلِهِۦ","وَحَكَمًا","مِّنْ","أَهْلِهَآ","إِن","يُرِيدَآ","إِصْلَٰحًا","يُوَفِّقِ","ٱللَّهُ","بَيْنَهُمَآ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَلِيمًا","خَبِيرًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-6-60-9","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"budi vas","en":"he/it awakens you (all)"},{"bs":"i poslali smo","en":"and we sent"},{"bs":"bivaju oživljeni","en":"they are resurrected"},{"bs":"proživjeli smo vas","en":"We raised you"}],"ref":"6:60","answerWord":"يَبْعَثُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/2ea5fb10af9565a2106b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who gathereth you at night and knoweth that which ye commit by day. Then He raiseth you again to life therein, that the term appointed (for you) may be accomplished. And afterward unto Him is your return. Then He will proclaim unto you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","بِٱلَّيْلِ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","جَرَحْتُم","بِٱلنَّهَارِ","ثُمَّ","يَبْعَثُكُمْ","فِيهِ","لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","أَجَلٌ","مُّسَمًّى","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-7-167-3","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista će poslati","en":"surely he/it will send"},{"bs":"oživio ga je","en":"he/it resurrected him"},{"bs":"probudili smo ih","en":"we awakened them"},{"bs":"zar je poslao?","en":"did he/it send?"}],"ref":"7:167","answerWord":"لَيَبْعَثَنَّ","answerSound":"audio/35e3fca0c354dfe553dc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when thy Lord proclaimed that He would raise against them till the Day of Resurrection those who would lay on them a cruel torment. Lo! verily thy Lord is swift in prosecution and lo! verily He is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","تَأَذَّنَ","رَبُّكَ","لَيَبْعَثَنَّ","عَلَيْهِمْ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","مَن","يَسُومُهُمْ","سُوٓءَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","لَسَرِيعُ","ٱلْعِقَابِ","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَغَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-17-15-19","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"šaljemo","en":"we send"},{"bs":"oživio ga je","en":"he/it resurrected him"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti oživljeni","en":"surely you (all) will be resurrected"},{"bs":"pošalji!","en":"send!"}],"ref":"17:15","answerWord":"نَبْعَثَ","answerSound":"audio/28d0ce138020fe5e41cc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whosoever goeth right, it is only for (the good of) his own soul that he goeth right, and whosoever erreth, erreth only to its hurt. No laden soul can bear another's load, We never punish until we have sent a messenger.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["مَّنِ","ٱهْتَدَىٰ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَهْتَدِى","لِنَفْسِهِۦ","وَمَن","ضَلَّ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَضِلُّ","عَلَيْهَا","وَلَا","تَزِرُ","وَازِرَةٌ","وِزْرَ","أُخْرَىٰ","وَمَا","كُنَّا","مُعَذِّبِينَ","حَتَّىٰ","نَبْعَثَ","رَسُولًا"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-17-79-8","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava te","en":"he/it resurrects you"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it resurrects"},{"bs":"pa pošaljite!","en":"so (you all) send!"},{"bs":"oživio ga je","en":"he/it resurrected him"}],"ref":"17:79","answerWord":"يَبْعَثَكَ","answerSound":"audio/60d6ca218450bbc6c40f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And some part of the night awake for it, a largess for thee. It may be that thy Lord will raise thee to a praised estate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","فَتَهَجَّدْ","بِهِۦ","نَافِلَةً","لَّكَ","عَسَىٰٓ","أَن","يَبْعَثَكَ","رَبُّكَ","مَقَامًا","مَّحْمُودًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-17-94-11","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"zar je poslao?","en":"did he/it send?"},{"bs":"biva oživljen","en":"he/it is resurrected"},{"bs":"bivaju oživljeni","en":"they are resurrected"},{"bs":"bivam oživljen","en":"I am resurrected"}],"ref":"17:94","answerWord":"أَبَعَثَ","answerSound":"audio/ddb3867c49a5841f3d22.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And naught prevented mankind from believing when the guidance came unto them save that they said: Hath Allah sent a mortal as (His) messenger?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَمَا","مَنَعَ","ٱلنَّاسَ","أَن","يُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","إِذْ","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","قَالُوٓا۟","أَبَعَثَ","ٱللَّهُ","بَشَرًا","رَّسُولًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-19-15-7","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"biva oživljen","en":"he/it is resurrected"},{"bs":"budi vas","en":"he/it awakens you (all)"},{"bs":"proživjeli smo vas","en":"We raised you"},{"bs":"pa je poslao","en":"so he/it sent"}],"ref":"19:15","answerWord":"يُبْعَثُ","answerSound":"audio/4df9479f49f2d219efe0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Peace on him the day he was born, and the day he dieth and the day he shall be raised alive!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَسَلَٰمٌ","عَلَيْهِ","يَوْمَ","وُلِدَ","وَيَوْمَ","يَمُوتُ","وَيَوْمَ","يُبْعَثُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-19-33-7","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"bivam oživljen","en":"I am resurrected"},{"bs":"pa je poslao","en":"so he/it sent"},{"bs":"probudili smo ih","en":"we awakened them"},{"bs":"šaljemo","en":"we send"}],"ref":"19:33","answerWord":"أُبْعَثُ","answerSound":"audio/c19a5f46f9e224c62f77.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Peace on me the day I was born, and the day I die, and the day I shall be raised alive!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["وَٱلسَّلَٰمُ","عَلَىَّ","يَوْمَ","وُلِدتُّ","وَيَوْمَ","أَمُوتُ","وَيَوْمَ","أُبْعَثُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-23-16-4","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"bivate oživljeni","en":"you (all) are resurrected"},{"bs":"oživio ga je","en":"he/it resurrected him"},{"bs":"biva oživljen","en":"he/it is resurrected"},{"bs":"zaista će poslati","en":"surely he/it will send"}],"ref":"23:16","answerWord":"تُبْعَثُونَ","answerSound":"audio/0a6d25d4f0e49c38b019.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then lo! on the Day of Resurrection ye are raised (again).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","إِنَّكُمْ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","تُبْعَثُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"baatha-36-52-3","words":["verb:baatha"],"options":[{"bs":"oživio nas je","en":"he/it resurrected us"},{"bs":"bivaju oživljeni","en":"they are resurrected"},{"bs":"oživljava te","en":"he/it resurrects you"},{"bs":"pa je poslao","en":"so he/it sent"}],"ref":"36:52","answerWord":"بَعَثَنَا","answerSound":"audio/489fc7c260b7b22cbc45.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Crying: Woe upon us! Who hath raised us from our place of sleep? This is that which the Beneficent did promise, and the messengers spoke truth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"poslati, proživjeti","en":"to send, to raise"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","يَٰوَيْلَنَا","مَنۢ","بَعَثَنَا","مِن","مَّرْقَدِنَا","هَٰذَا","مَا","وَعَدَ","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنُ","وَصَدَقَ","ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"بَعَثَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-3-41-17","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavi!","en":"and glorify!"},{"bs":"slavite!","en":"(you all) glorify!"},{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"},{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"}],"ref":"3:41","answerWord":"وَسَبِّحْ","answerSound":"audio/4270aa415f4a73ce746c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: My Lord! Appoint a token for me. (The angel) said: The token unto thee (shall be) that thou shalt not speak unto mankind three days except by signs. Remember thy Lord much, and praise (Him) in the early hours of night and morning.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["قَالَ","رَبِّ","ٱجْعَل","لِّىٓ","ءَايَةً","قَالَ","ءَايَتُكَ","أَلَّا","تُكَلِّمَ","ٱلنَّاسَ","ثَلَٰثَةَ","أَيَّامٍ","إِلَّا","رَمْزًا","وَٱذْكُر","رَّبَّكَ","كَثِيرًا","وَسَبِّحْ","بِٱلْعَشِىِّ","وَٱلْإِبْكَٰرِ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-56-74-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa slavi!","en":"so glorify!"},{"bs":"pa ga slavi!","en":"so glorify him!"},{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"},{"bs":"slavite!","en":"(you all) glorify!"}],"ref":"56:74","answerWord":"فَسَبِّحْ","answerSound":"audio/8e2b4e0b9862eafa98f0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefor (O Muhammad), praise the name of thy Lord, the Tremendous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["فَسَبِّحْ","بِٱسْمِ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلْعَظِيمِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-62-1-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavi","en":"he/it glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavite ga","en":"and you (all) glorify him"},{"bs":"i slavi!","en":"and glorify!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"}],"ref":"62:1","answerWord":"يُسَبِّحُ","answerSound":"audio/0b7128bf7dcdffe4173e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"All that is in the heavens and all that is in the earth glorifieth Allah, the Sovereign Lord, the Holy One, the Mighty, the Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["يُسَبِّحُ","لِلَّهِ","مَا","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَمَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ٱلْمَلِكِ","ٱلْقُدُّوسِ","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلْحَكِيمِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-21-20-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"},{"bs":"slavi","en":"glorifies"},{"bs":"slavimo","en":"we glorify"}],"ref":"21:20","answerWord":"يُسَبِّحُونَ","answerSound":"audio/4596b3f1464988715517.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They glorify (Him) night and day; they flag not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["يُسَبِّحُونَ","ٱلَّيْلَ","وَٱلنَّهَارَ","لَا","يَفْتُرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-57-1-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavi","en":"glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavi","en":"and he/it glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavite ga","en":"and you (all) glorify him"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"}],"ref":"57:1","answerWord":"سَبَّحَ","answerSound":"audio/cc1a05980b65ddfb403a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"All that is in the heavens and the earth glorifieth Allah; and He is the Mighty, the Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["سَبَّحَ","لِلَّهِ","مَا","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَهُوَ","ٱلْعَزِيزُ","ٱلْحَكِيمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-21-79-10","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"slavi","en":"glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavi!","en":"and glorify!"},{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"}],"ref":"21:79","answerWord":"يُسَبِّحْنَ","answerSound":"audio/81d146418456a0e3e00d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We made Solomon to understand (the case); and unto each of them We gave judgment and knowledge. And we subdued the hills and the birds to hymn (His) praise along with David. We were the doers (thereof).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["فَفَهَّمْنَٰهَا","سُلَيْمَٰنَ","وَكُلًّا","ءَاتَيْنَا","حُكْمًا","وَعِلْمًا","وَسَخَّرْنَا","مَعَ","دَاوُۥدَ","ٱلْجِبَالَ","يُسَبِّحْنَ","وَٱلطَّيْرَ","وَكُنَّا","فَٰعِلِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-50-40-2","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga slavi!","en":"so glorify him!"},{"bs":"i slavite ga","en":"and you (all) glorify him"},{"bs":"pa slavi!","en":"so glorify!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"}],"ref":"50:40","answerWord":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","answerSound":"audio/efda76f4acd61a6dd495.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And in the night-time hymn His praise, and after the (prescribed) prostrations.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","فَسَبِّحْهُ","وَأَدْبَٰرَ","ٱلسُّجُودِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-2-30-18","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavimo","en":"we glorify"},{"bs":"slavi","en":"he/it glorifies"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"}],"ref":"2:30","answerWord":"نُسَبِّحُ","answerSound":"audio/128ae7e2771103f05070.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when thy Lord said unto the angels: Lo! I am about to place a viceroy in the earth, they said: Wilt thou place therein one who will do harm therein and will shed blood, while we, we hymn Thy praise and sanctify Thee? He said: Surely I know that which ye know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","رَبُّكَ","لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","إِنِّى","جَاعِلٌ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","خَلِيفَةً","قَالُوٓا۟","أَتَجْعَلُ","فِيهَا","مَن","يُفْسِدُ","فِيهَا","وَيَسْفِكُ","ٱلدِّمَآءَ","وَنَحْنُ","نُسَبِّحُ","بِحَمْدِكَ","وَنُقَدِّسُ","لَكَ","قَالَ","إِنِّىٓ","أَعْلَمُ","مَا","لَا","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-7-206-8","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"},{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"},{"bs":"slavi","en":"he/it glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavi!","en":"and glorify!"}],"ref":"7:206","answerWord":"وَيُسَبِّحُونَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/b1cfc18b6db62187df91.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who are with thy Lord are not too proud to do Him service, but they praise Him and prostrate before Him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","عِندَ","رَبِّكَ","لَا","يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","عَنْ","عِبَادَتِهِۦ","وَيُسَبِّحُونَهُۥ","وَلَهُۥ","يَسْجُدُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-13-13-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavi","en":"and he/it glorifies"},{"bs":"slavi!","en":"glorify!"},{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"},{"bs":"slavite!","en":"(you all) glorify!"}],"ref":"13:13","answerWord":"وَيُسَبِّحُ","answerSound":"audio/88d5e237cf5389b00133.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The thunder hymneth His praise and (so do) the angels for awe of Him. He launcheth the thunderbolts and smiteth with them whom He will while they dispute (in doubt) concerning Allah, and He is mighty in wrath.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["وَيُسَبِّحُ","ٱلرَّعْدُ","بِحَمْدِهِۦ","وَٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","مِنْ","خِيفَتِهِۦ","وَيُرْسِلُ","ٱلصَّوَٰعِقَ","فَيُصِيبُ","بِهَا","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَهُمْ","يُجَٰدِلُونَ","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","وَهُوَ","شَدِيدُ","ٱلْمِحَالِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-19-11-8","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavite!","en":"(you all) glorify!"},{"bs":"pa ga slavi!","en":"so glorify him!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"}],"ref":"19:11","answerWord":"سَبِّحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8e1075b12dc0c4a36744.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then he came forth unto his people from the sanctuary, and signified to them: Glorify your Lord at break of day and fall of night.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["فَخَرَجَ","عَلَىٰ","قَوْمِهِۦ","مِنَ","ٱلْمِحْرَابِ","فَأَوْحَىٰٓ","إِلَيْهِمْ","أَن","سَبِّحُوا۟","بُكْرَةً","وَعَشِيًّا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-20-33-1","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"},{"bs":"pa slavi!","en":"so glorify!"},{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"}],"ref":"20:33","answerWord":"نُسَبِّحَكَ","answerSound":"audio/8e79fc9a4768d4184149.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That we may glorify Thee much","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["كَىْ","نُسَبِّحَكَ","كَثِيرًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-32-15-9","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavili su","en":"and they glorified"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"slavi!","en":"glorify!"},{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"}],"ref":"32:15","answerWord":"وَسَبَّحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ac5f1897d8ee13f68bf8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Only those believe in Our revelations who, when they are reminded of them, fall down prostrate and hymn the praise of their Lord, and they are not scornful,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","يُؤْمِنُ","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","ذُكِّرُوا۟","بِهَا","خَرُّوا۟","سُجَّدًا","وَسَبَّحُوا۟","بِحَمْدِ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-33-42-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavite Ga!","en":"and glorify Him!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"slavi!","en":"glorify!"},{"bs":"slavite","en":"you (all) glorify"}],"ref":"33:42","answerWord":"وَسَبِّحُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/ba1881844da5e3613cf6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And glorify Him early and late.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["وَسَبِّحُوهُ","بُكْرَةً","وَأَصِيلًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-48-9-5","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavite ga","en":"and you (all) glorify him"},{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"},{"bs":"slavi","en":"glorifies"},{"bs":"i slavi","en":"and he/it glorifies"}],"ref":"48:9","answerWord":"وَتُسَبِّحُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/1fb76d48f47dc2d07ae0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That ye (mankind) may believe in Allah and His messenger, and may honour Him, and may revere Him, and may glorify Him at early dawn and at the close of day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["لِّتُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","وَتُعَزِّرُوهُ","وَتُوَقِّرُوهُ","وَتُسَبِّحُوهُ","بُكْرَةً","وَأَصِيلًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-68-28-6","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavite","en":"you (all) glorify"},{"bs":"pa slavi!","en":"so glorify!"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"},{"bs":"i slave ga","en":"and they glorify him"}],"ref":"68:28","answerWord":"تُسَبِّحُونَ","answerSound":"audio/23ff96158157439e2571.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The best among them said: Said I not unto you: Why glorify ye not (Allah)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَوْسَطُهُمْ","أَلَمْ","أَقُل","لَّكُمْ","لَوْلَا","تُسَبِّحُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-76-26-4","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i slavi ga!","en":"and glorify him!"},{"bs":"i slavi!","en":"and glorify!"},{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"},{"bs":"slave","en":"they glorify"}],"ref":"76:26","answerWord":"وَسَبِّحْهُ","answerSound":"audio/1f67d5327cd0a5fcd39e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And worship Him (a portion) of the night. And glorify Him through the livelong night.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","فَٱسْجُدْ","لَهُۥ","وَسَبِّحْهُ","لَيْلًا","طَوِيلًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"sabbaha-87-1-0","words":["verb:sabbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"slavi!","en":"glorify!"},{"bs":"(da) Te slavimo","en":"(that) we may glorify You"},{"bs":"i slavili su","en":"and they glorified"},{"bs":"i slavi ga!","en":"and glorify him!"}],"ref":"87:1","answerWord":"سَبِّحِ","answerSound":"audio/f98ed4ce321637a7c94a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Praise the name of thy Lord the Most High,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"slaviti, veličati","en":"to glorify, to praise"},"passage":["سَبِّحِ","ٱسْمَ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلْأَعْلَى"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَبَّحَ"}},{"id":"badaa-30-11-1","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"},{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"pa je počeo","en":"so he/it began"},{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"he/it originated you (all)"}],"ref":"30:11","answerWord":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","answerSound":"audio/d1d0ad78ad78e8c0af5a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah produceth creation, then He reproduceth it, then unto Him ye will be returned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","يَبْدَؤُا۟","ٱلْخَلْقَ","ثُمَّ","يُعِيدُهُۥ","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"badaa-7-29-14","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"he/it originated you (all)"},{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"},{"bs":"počeo je","en":"he/it began"}],"ref":"7:29","answerWord":"بَدَأَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/923a2f5b73dafcb95958.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: My Lord enjoineth justice. And set your faces upright (toward Him) at every place of worship and call upon Him, making religion pure for Him (only). As He brought you into being, so return ye (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَمَرَ","رَبِّى","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","وَأَقِيمُوا۟","وُجُوهَكُمْ","عِندَ","كُلِّ","مَسْجِدٍ","وَٱدْعُوهُ","مُخْلِصِينَ","لَهُ","ٱلدِّينَ","كَمَا","بَدَأَكُمْ","تَعُودُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"badaa-9-13-9","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"i započeo je","en":"and He began"},{"bs":"počeli smo","en":"we began"},{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"}],"ref":"9:13","answerWord":"بَدَءُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a3a4c52a022d2df5a44d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Will ye not fight a folk who broke their solemn pledges, and purposed to drive out the messenger and did attack you first? What! Fear ye them? Now Allah hath more right that ye should fear Him, if ye are believers","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["أَلَا","تُقَٰتِلُونَ","قَوْمًا","نَّكَثُوٓا۟","أَيْمَٰنَهُمْ","وَهَمُّوا۟","بِإِخْرَاجِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ","وَهُم","بَدَءُوكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","أَتَخْشَوْنَهُمْ","فَٱللَّهُ","أَحَقُّ","أَن","تَخْشَوْهُ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"badaa-21-104-7","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"počeli smo","en":"we began"},{"bs":"pa je počeo","en":"so he/it began"},{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"}],"ref":"21:104","answerWord":"بَدَأْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/3a7ffb6a64be40f69c1f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Day when We shall roll up the heavens as a recorder rolleth up a written scroll. As We began the first creation, We shall repeat it. (It is) a promise (binding) upon Us. Lo! We are to perform it.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","نَطْوِى","ٱلسَّمَآءَ","كَطَىِّ","ٱلسِّجِلِّ","لِلْكُتُبِ","كَمَا","بَدَأْنَآ","أَوَّلَ","خَلْقٍ","نُّعِيدُهُۥ","وَعْدًا","عَلَيْنَآ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","فَٰعِلِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"badaa-29-20-6","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"počeo je","en":"he/it began"},{"bs":"počeli smo","en":"we began"},{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"}],"ref":"29:20","answerWord":"بَدَأَ","answerSound":"audio/69649ed2e1b13afb14ef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (O Muhammad): Travel in the land and see how He originated creation, then Allah bringeth forth the later growth. Lo! Allah is Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["قُلْ","سِيرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَٱنظُرُوا۟","كَيْفَ","بَدَأَ","ٱلْخَلْقَ","ثُمَّ","ٱللَّهُ","يُنشِئُ","ٱلنَّشْأَةَ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"badaa-32-7-5","words":["verb:badaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i započeo je","en":"and He began"},{"bs":"prvi su vas napali","en":"they attacked you (all) first"},{"bs":"započinje","en":"begins"},{"bs":"počeli smo","en":"we began"}],"ref":"32:7","answerWord":"وَبَدَأَ","answerSound":"audio/c4127945774a1824d15d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who made all things good which He created, and He began the creation of man from clay;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"početi, započeti","en":"to begin, to start"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحْسَنَ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","خَلَقَهُۥ","وَبَدَأَ","خَلْقَ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنِ","مِن","طِينٍ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"بَدَأَ"}},{"id":"irtaba-9-45-8","words":["verb:irtaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i posumnjala je","en":"and she/it doubted"},{"bs":"sumnja","en":"he/it doubts"},{"bs":"posumnjali ste","en":"you (all) doubted"},{"bs":"sumnjaju","en":"they doubt"}],"ref":"9:45","answerWord":"وَٱرْتَابَتْ","answerSound":"audio/f997da36457c8b27c4fd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They alone ask leave of thee who believe not in Allah and the Last Day, and whose hearts feel doubt, so in their doubt they waver.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"posumnjati","en":"to doubt, to be suspicious"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَٱرْتَابَتْ","قُلُوبُهُمْ","فَهُمْ","فِى","رَيْبِهِمْ","يَتَرَدَّدُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"ارْتابَ"}},{"id":"irtaba-49-15-8","words":["verb:irtaba"],"options":[{"bs":"sumnjaju","en":"they doubt"},{"bs":"i posumnjali ste","en":"and you (all) doubted"},{"bs":"sumnjate","en":"you (all) doubt"},{"bs":"posumnjali su","en":"they doubted"}],"ref":"49:15","answerWord":"يَرْتَابُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/fade10eb3722a33147c3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The (true) believers are those only who believe in Allah and His messenger and afterward doubt not, but strive with their wealth and their lives for the cause of Allah. Such are the sincere.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"posumnjati","en":"to doubt, to be suspicious"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَرْتَابُوا۟","وَجَٰهَدُوا۟","بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلصَّٰدِقُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"ارْتابَ"}},{"id":"irtaba-57-14-10","words":["verb:irtaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i posumnjali ste","en":"and you (all) doubted"},{"bs":"sumnja","en":"he/it doubts"},{"bs":"i posumnjala je","en":"and she/it doubted"},{"bs":"sumnjate","en":"you (all) doubt"}],"ref":"57:14","answerWord":"وَٱرْتَبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/b777527a3b05147ac9fb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will cry unto them (saying): Were we not with you? They will say: Yea, verily; but ye tempted one another, and hesitated, and doubted, and vain desires beguiled you till the ordinance of Allah came to pass; and the deceiver deceived you concerning Allah;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"posumnjati","en":"to doubt, to be suspicious"},"passage":["يُنَادُونَهُمْ","أَلَمْ","نَكُن","مَّعَكُمْ","قَالُوا۟","بَلَىٰ","وَلَٰكِنَّكُمْ","فَتَنتُمْ","أَنفُسَكُمْ","وَتَرَبَّصْتُمْ","وَٱرْتَبْتُمْ","وَغَرَّتْكُمُ","ٱلْأَمَانِىُّ","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَغَرَّكُم","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْغَرُورُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"ارْتابَ"}},{"id":"intazara-7-71-20","words":["verb:intazara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa čekajte!","en":"so (you all) wait!"},{"bs":"čeka","en":"he/it waits"},{"bs":"čekaju","en":"they wait"},{"bs":"i čekaj!","en":"and wait!"}],"ref":"7:71","answerWord":"فَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/b8e24163bde036b2a7fe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Terror and wrath from your Lord have already fallen on you. Would ye wrangle with me over names which ye have named, ye and your fathers, for which no warrant from Allah hath been revealed? Then await (the consequence), lo! I (also) am of those awaiting (it).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čekati, očekivati","en":"to wait, to expect"},"passage":["قَالَ","قَدْ","وَقَعَ","عَلَيْكُم","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","رِجْسٌ","وَغَضَبٌ","أَتُجَٰدِلُونَنِى","فِىٓ","أَسْمَآءٍ","سَمَّيْتُمُوهَآ","أَنتُمْ","وَءَابَآؤُكُم","مَّا","نَزَّلَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِهَا","مِن","سُلْطَٰنٍ","فَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟","إِنِّى","مَعَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُنتَظِرِينَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"انْتَظَرَ"}},{"id":"intazara-10-102-1","words":["verb:intazara"],"options":[{"bs":"čekaju","en":"they wait"},{"bs":"čekajte!","en":"(you all) wait!"},{"bs":"čeka","en":"he/it waits"},{"bs":"i čekaj!","en":"and wait!"}],"ref":"10:102","answerWord":"يَنتَظِرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/1a8613ccdf23e91b502a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"What expect they save the like of the days of those who passed away before them? Say: Expect then! I am with you among the expectant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čekati, očekivati","en":"to wait, to expect"},"passage":["فَهَلْ","يَنتَظِرُونَ","إِلَّا","مِثْلَ","أَيَّامِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَلَوْا۟","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","قُلْ","فَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟","إِنِّى","مَعَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُنتَظِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"انْتَظَرَ"}},{"id":"intazara-32-30-2","words":["verb:intazara"],"options":[{"bs":"i čekaj!","en":"and wait!"},{"bs":"pa čekajte!","en":"so (you all) wait!"},{"bs":"čekaju","en":"they wait"},{"bs":"čeka","en":"he/it waits"}],"ref":"32:30","answerWord":"وَٱنتَظِرْ","answerSound":"audio/00923e53683883220056.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So withdraw from them (O Muhammad), and await (the event). Lo! they (also) are awaiting (it).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čekati, očekivati","en":"to wait, to expect"},"passage":["فَأَعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","وَٱنتَظِرْ","إِنَّهُم","مُّنتَظِرُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"انْتَظَرَ"}},{"id":"tanazzala-19-64-1","words":["verb:tanazzala"],"options":[{"bs":"spuštamo se","en":"we come down"},{"bs":"spušta se","en":"he/it comes down"},{"bs":"spustili su ga","en":"brought (it) down"},{"bs":"silaze","en":"they descend"}],"ref":"19:64","answerWord":"نَتَنَزَّلُ","answerSound":"audio/dc96a5fd7d8ed63ba26e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We (angels) come not down save by commandment of thy Lord. Unto Him belongeth all that is before us and all that is behind us and all that is between those two, and thy Lord was never forgetful -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spuštati se, silaziti","en":"to come down, to descend"},"passage":["وَمَا","نَتَنَزَّلُ","إِلَّا","بِأَمْرِ","رَبِّكَ","لَهُۥ","مَا","بَيْنَ","أَيْدِينَا","وَمَا","خَلْفَنَا","وَمَا","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَا","كَانَ","رَبُّكَ","نَسِيًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَنَزَّلَ"}},{"id":"tanazzala-26-210-1","words":["verb:tanazzala"],"options":[{"bs":"spustili su ga","en":"brought (it) down"},{"bs":"spuštamo se","en":"we come down"},{"bs":"spušta se","en":"he/it comes down"},{"bs":"silaze","en":"they descend"}],"ref":"26:210","answerWord":"تَنَزَّلَتْ","answerSound":"audio/4085cd628ca161bb11ef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The devils did not bring it down.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spuštati se, silaziti","en":"to come down, to descend"},"passage":["وَمَا","تَنَزَّلَتْ","بِهِ","ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَنَزَّلَ"}},{"id":"tanazzala-65-12-8","words":["verb:tanazzala"],"options":[{"bs":"spušta se","en":"he/it comes down"},{"bs":"silaze","en":"they descend"},{"bs":"spuštamo se","en":"we come down"},{"bs":"spustili su ga","en":"brought (it) down"}],"ref":"65:12","answerWord":"يَتَنَزَّلُ","answerSound":"audio/9af95015f8614281a914.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah it is who hath created seven heavens, and of the earth the like thereof. The commandment cometh down among them slowly, that ye may know that Allah is Able to do all things, and that Allah surroundeth all things in knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spuštati se, silaziti","en":"to come down, to descend"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَ","سَبْعَ","سَمَٰوَٰتٍ","وَمِنَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","مِثْلَهُنَّ","يَتَنَزَّلُ","ٱلْأَمْرُ","بَيْنَهُنَّ","لِتَعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ","وَأَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","قَدْ","أَحَاطَ","بِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","عِلْمًۢا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"تَنَزَّلَ"}},{"id":"hammala-20-87-6","words":["verb:hammala"],"options":[{"bs":"natovareni smo","en":"we were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni ste","en":"you (all) were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni su","en":"they were loaded"},{"bs":"natovaren je","en":"he/it was loaded"}],"ref":"20:87","answerWord":"حُمِّلْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/b04d64bea53f1028d681.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We broke not tryst with thee of our own will, but we were laden with burdens of ornaments of the folk, then cast them (in the fire), for thus As-Samiri proposed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"natovariti, opteretiti","en":"to load, to burden"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","مَآ","أَخْلَفْنَا","مَوْعِدَكَ","بِمَلْكِنَا","وَلَٰكِنَّا","حُمِّلْنَآ","أَوْزَارًا","مِّن","زِينَةِ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","فَقَذَفْنَٰهَا","فَكَذَٰلِكَ","أَلْقَى","ٱلسَّامِرِىُّ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَّلَ"}},{"id":"hammala-24-54-10","words":["verb:hammala"],"options":[{"bs":"natovaren je","en":"he/it was loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni su","en":"they were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni ste","en":"you (all) were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni smo","en":"we were loaded"}],"ref":"24:54","answerWord":"حُمِّلَ","answerSound":"audio/2ee856e3a54d480dc7f4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Obey Allah and obey the messenger. But if ye turn away, then (it is) for him (to do) only that wherewith he hath been charged, and for you (to do) only that wherewith ye have been charged. If ye obey him, ye will go aright. But the messenger hath no other charge than to convey (the message) plainly.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"natovariti, opteretiti","en":"to load, to burden"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنَّمَا","عَلَيْهِ","مَا","حُمِّلَ","وَعَلَيْكُم","مَّا","حُمِّلْتُمْ","وَإِن","تُطِيعُوهُ","تَهْتَدُوا۟","وَمَا","عَلَى","ٱلرَّسُولِ","إِلَّا","ٱلْبَلَٰغُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَّلَ"}},{"id":"hammala-24-54-13","words":["verb:hammala"],"options":[{"bs":"natovareni ste","en":"you (all) were loaded"},{"bs":"natovaren je","en":"he/it was loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni su","en":"they were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni smo","en":"we were loaded"}],"ref":"24:54","answerWord":"حُمِّلْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/3586554fa8cc8976802e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Obey Allah and obey the messenger. But if ye turn away, then (it is) for him (to do) only that wherewith he hath been charged, and for you (to do) only that wherewith ye have been charged. If ye obey him, ye will go aright. But the messenger hath no other charge than to convey (the message) plainly.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"natovariti, opteretiti","en":"to load, to burden"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنَّمَا","عَلَيْهِ","مَا","حُمِّلَ","وَعَلَيْكُم","مَّا","حُمِّلْتُمْ","وَإِن","تُطِيعُوهُ","تَهْتَدُوا۟","وَمَا","عَلَى","ٱلرَّسُولِ","إِلَّا","ٱلْبَلَٰغُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَّلَ"}},{"id":"hammala-62-5-2","words":["verb:hammala"],"options":[{"bs":"natovareni su","en":"they were loaded"},{"bs":"natovaren je","en":"he/it was loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni smo","en":"we were loaded"},{"bs":"natovareni ste","en":"you (all) were loaded"}],"ref":"62:5","answerWord":"حُمِّلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ec6180863e4ded139e74.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The likeness of those who are entrusted with the Law of Moses, yet apply it not, is as the likeness of the ass carrying books. Wretched is the likeness of folk who deny the revelations of Allah. And Allah guideth not wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"natovariti, opteretiti","en":"to load, to burden"},"passage":["مَثَلُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","حُمِّلُوا۟","ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَحْمِلُوهَا","كَمَثَلِ","ٱلْحِمَارِ","يَحْمِلُ","أَسْفَارًۢا","بِئْسَ","مَثَلُ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَّلَ"}}]